    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1036">

                <pb facs="1421" n="1409" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg1409"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.92/12–2545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Political Adviser in Siam</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Yost</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-25T13:00:00+07:00">December 25,
                            1945—1 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:18 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>96. Reurtel 80, December 22, 4 p.m. Believe January 1 would be wholly suitable
                    day. Formal agreement may not be concluded until <pb facs="1422" n="1410"
                        xml:id="pg1410"/> some time in January but it would seem quite proper for us
                    to act after Heads of Agreement have been signed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Yost</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
